                            com.claudemod.entity.life.Perception.lookNow(c); com.claudemod.entity.life.Perception.felt(c, z); // he knows all three: the skeletons ahead in sight, the zombie behind him (it bumped him) (unknown, the crowd rule never saw a crowd)
